            "review_title": "Review at Yerba Mate - Matéa (saigon)",
            "review_text": "Perrot4000\n4 contributions\n0\nYerba Mate - Cozy furniture - Friendly staff - Great vibes - must visit if looking for Yerba.\nApr 2025 • Solo\nThis place is a most go - if you are looking for Yerba Mate. Only place I could find in Saigon. But I heard it from their shop in Hanoi. \n\nAbsolute pearl with brands from Argentina and Uruguay. \n\nThe shop i cozy and inviting for a break to enjoy a gourd of Yerba.\nRead more\nWritten April 30, 2025",
